# Default CODEOWNERS for all Involvex repos
#
# This file defines default code owners for the organization.
# Individual repositories can override by providing their own CODEOWNERS file.
#
# Pattern reference: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-in-github/about-code-owners
#
# User format:
#   @involvex

# Default owner for all files
*                       @involvex

# Documentation
*.md                    @involvex
docs/**                 @involvex

# Configuration & CI
.github/**              @involvex
*.yml                   @involvex
*.yaml                  @involvex
*.json                  @involvex
*.toml                  @involvex

# CI/CD workflow files
.github/workflows/**    @involvex

# Issue & PR templates
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/**         @involvex
.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE*    @involvex

# Security & community health files
.github/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md    @involvex
.github/CONTRIBUTING.md       @involvex
.github/SECURITY.md           @involvex
.github/SUPPORT.md            @involvex
.github/FUNDING.yml           @involvex

# Build & package files
package.json              @involvex
tsconfig.json             @involvex
tsconfig.*.json           @involvex
bun.lockb                 @involvex
